## 5. How Compose Multiplatform, Koin, Navigation3 Are Wired Together

### Koin initialization — `composeApp/src/commonMain/kotlin/template/KoinApp.kt`

```kotlin
// expect declared per-platform:
expect val appPlatformModule: Module

private val appModule = module {
    factory { (navigationCallback: SplashNavigationCallback) ->
        SplashViewModel(navigationCallback)
    }
    factory { (initArg: String, navigationCallback: MainNavigationCallback) ->
        MainViewModel(initArg, navigationCallback)
    }
}

@Composable
fun KoinApp() {
    KoinMultiplatformApplication(
        config = {
            modules(appModule, appPlatformModule, coreCommonModule, corePrefModule)
        }
    ) {
        NavApp()
    }
}
```

Platform-specific `appPlatformModule` actual declarations:

- `composeApp/src/androidMain/kotlin/template/KoinAndroid.kt` — provides `PrefPathProvider` pointing to `<filesDir>/app.pref.json` as an Okio `Path`
- `composeApp/src/jvmMain/kotlin/template/KoinDesktop.kt` — provides `PrefPathProvider` pointing to a temp file (JVM desktop)
- `composeApp/src/webMain/kotlin/template/KoinWeb.kt` — `actual val appPlatformModule = module {}` (empty — web uses in-memory storage)

### Navigation3 — `navigation/src/commonMain/kotlin/template/navigation/NavApp.kt`

```kotlin
// Uses androidx.navigation3
sealed interface AppRoutes {
    @Serializable data object Splash : AppRoutes
    @Serializable data class Main(val initArg: String) : AppRoutes
}

@Composable
fun NavApp() {
    val backStack = remember { mutableStateListOf<AppRoutes>(AppRoutes.Splash) }
    val appNavigation = remember { AppNavigation(backStack) }

    NavDisplay(
        backStack = backStack,
        onBack = { if (backStack.size > 1) backStack.removeLast() },
        entryProvider = entryProvider {
            entry<AppRoutes.Splash> {
                val vm: SplashViewModel = koin.get { parametersOf(appNavigation) }
                SplashScreen(vm)
            }
            entry<AppRoutes.Main> { route ->
                val vm: MainViewModel = koin.get { parametersOf(route.initArg, appNavigation) }
                MainScreen(vm)
            }
        }
    )
}
```

`navigation/src/commonMain/kotlin/template/navigation/AppNavigation.kt`:
```kotlin
internal class AppNavigation(
    private val backStack: MutableList<NavKey>
) : MainNavigationCallback, SplashNavigationCallback {

    override fun goBack() {
        if (backStack.size > 1) backStack.removeLast()
    }

    override fun goMainScreen() {
        backStack.add(AppRoutes.Main(initArg = "someArg"))
        backStack.remove(AppRoutes.Splash)
    }
}
```

