## 7. androidx.datastore.core.okio Pattern in KMP

This is the critical multiplatform DataStore pattern. The library `androidx.datastore:datastore-core-okio` is added to `androidMain`, `jvmMain`, and `iosMain` source sets (but **not** `webMain`).

### `PrefPathProvider` interface (commonMain)

```kotlin
// core/corePref/src/commonMain/kotlin/template/core/pref/PrefPathProvider.kt
package template.core.pref
import okio.Path

interface PrefPathProvider {
    fun get(): Path
}
```

### `PrefSerializer` (shared across android/ios/jvm, implements `OkioSerializer<PrefData>`)

```kotlin
class PrefSerializer : OkioSerializer<PrefData> {
    private val parser = Json { ignoreUnknownKeys = true }

    override val defaultValue: PrefData = PrefData(key = null)

    override suspend fun readFrom(source: BufferedSource): PrefData =
        try { parser.decodeFromString(source.readUtf8()) }
        catch (e: Exception) { defaultValue }

    override suspend fun writeTo(t: PrefData, sink: BufferedSink) {
        sink.writeUtf8(parser.encodeToString(t))
    }
}
```

### `PrefServiceDataStore` (shared across android/ios/jvm)

```kotlin
class PrefServiceDataStore(private val prefPathProvider: PrefPathProvider) : PrefService {
    private val parser by lazy { Json { prettyPrint = true } }

    private val dataStore by lazy {
        DataStoreFactory.create(
            storage = OkioStorage(
                fileSystem = FileSystem.SYSTEM,
                serializer = PrefSerializer(),
                producePath = { prefPathProvider.get() }
            )
        )
    }

    override fun getUserPreferenceContent(): Flow<String?> =
        dataStore.data.map { parser.encodeToString(it) }

    override fun getKey(): Flow<String?> =
        dataStore.data.map { it.key }

    override suspend fun setKey(key: String?) {
        dataStore.updateData { it.copy(key = key) }
    }
}
```

### Platform-specific `PrefPathProvider` actual implementations via Koin

**Android** (in `composeApp/src/androidMain/kotlin/template/KoinAndroid.kt`):
```kotlin
actual val appPlatformModule: Module = module {
    single<PrefPathProvider> {
        object : PrefPathProvider {
            override fun get(): Path = runBlocking(get<DispatcherSet>().ioDispatcher()) {
                get<Application>().filesDir.resolve("app.pref.json").absolutePath.toPath()
            }
        }
    }
}
```

**JVM Desktop** (`composeApp/src/jvmMain/kotlin/template/KoinDesktop.kt`):
```kotlin
actual val appPlatformModule: Module = module {
    single<PrefPathProvider> {
        object : PrefPathProvider {
            override fun get(): Path = runBlocking(get<DispatcherSet>().ioDispatcher()) {
                File.createTempFile("temp_", "app.pref.json").absolutePath.toPath()
            }
        }
    }
}
```

**iOS** (`iosMain`): similar `PrefPathProvider` pointing to NSDocumentDirectory.

**Web** (`webMain`): empty `appPlatformModule`, `corePrefModule` provides `PrefServiceMemory` (in-memory `MutableStateFlow<PrefData>`).

